    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21251" root="سوع" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ ضَائِعٌ سَائِعٌ</span></b>  <i>He is left to himself, left alone,</i>
or <i>neglected.</i> (S, * K, * TA.) ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاعَةٌ</span></b>  [is pl. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَائِعٌ</span>; and also signifies] <i>In a state of perdition</i>
or <i>destruction; perishing;</i> or <i>dying; in a pl.
sense;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاعَةٌ</span> as signifying <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِيَاعٌ</span>, (K,) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَاعَةٌ</span> as signifying <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُطِيعُونَ</span>. (TA.)

